Z||000008||Cliff Pennock||10-10-2001||03:48 PM||||Skitime, I think you are using PIP, and if you do, there's no need to upload the same pic every time you want to use it in a message. To re-use an earlier uploaded picture, click on the "History" button of PIP, find the image, and click on the button directly below the image. This will save me <B>a lot</B> of diskspace. I've noticed you've uploaded this picture <B>13</B> times already!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> And the way PIP works, it will not overwrite an earlier uploaded version, but create a new one.||||reg||1
